.TH ARMYBOX-APPLETS 7 "2026-02-08" "armybox 0.3.0" "ArmyBox Manual"
.\"
.SH NAME
armybox-applets \- complete list of armybox applets with descriptions
.\"
.SH DESCRIPTION
This page lists every applet provided by
.BR armybox (1),
organized by category.
Each applet can be invoked either through a symlink or via
.BI "armybox " APPLET
.IR ARGS .\|.\|.
.PP
Applets marked with \fB[P]\fR are defined by POSIX.1-2017.
Applets marked with \fB[L]\fR are Linux-specific extensions.
.\"
